> command definition could look like
>
> \@startsection{section}{1}{\afterindentfalse
>                            \runinfalse
>                            \headbeforeskip 10pt plus 5 pt
>                            \headafterskip 5pt plus 3 pt
>                            ...}
>                           {....}...
>
